        "contentUdi": "umb://element/a446af515cc64055828893420d5fa8c3",
        "settingsKey": null,
        "settingsUdi": null
      }
    ]
  }
}]]></Value>
    </blockList>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[Add your match results to this website to see your updated league table and detailed statistics for your team, your league, and all of your players.]]></Value>
    </description>
